      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{6161a61a2c0de966b4e43486|full_name}: I'm not sure how I'd hit the space bar while standing in T-position to calibrate, what did you have in mind here?\n\nAs someone who literally has only one hand, I find this arbitrary requirement a bit awkward to deal with.  Imagine me T-posing with a piece of string to pull the left button with my right hand :)\n\nHow hard would it really be to have an option to just use a single button?  Simply saying \"use a third-party tool\" seems really dismissive.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
